{"seq":2,"slug":"query","title":"查询处理与排序","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/full-text-search-engine-implementation/query","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"query-processing","title":"布尔与短语查询处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/full-text-search-engine-implementation/query/query-processing","wordCount":1318,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"ranking-bm25","title":"相关性排序与 BM25","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/full-text-search-engine-implementation/query/ranking-bm25","wordCount":1289,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"query-evaluation-topk","title":"Top-K 检索与提前终止","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/full-text-search-engine-implementation/query/query-evaluation-topk","wordCount":1449,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"查询处理与排序\">查询处理与排序</h1><p>索引建好只是一半，另一半是当查询到来时如何用好它。这一章顺着一次查询的真实生命周期展开：先把查询解析成对倒排表的集合运算，再给每个命中文档算出相关性分数，最后只把最好的几条挑出来——三步对应三篇文档。</p>\n<p>第一篇讲布尔与短语查询处理。用户输入的字符串要先被解析、改写成由 AND、OR、NOT 组成的布尔表达式，每个词项对应一条倒排表，求交求并就是在多条递增整数流上做归并。短语查询更进一步，要用上倒排表里存的位置信息，确认词与词的相邻关系。这一篇是后两篇的前提：没有命中集合，就谈不上排序与剪枝。</p>\n<p>第二篇讲相关性排序与 BM25。命中往往成千上万，得有个分数把最相关的排到前面。我们从 TF-IDF 的直觉讲到 BM25 的完整公式，逐项拆解词频饱和、文档长度归一化背后的设计意图，以及 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 两个参数到底在调什么。BM25 是 Lucene 与 Elasticsearch 默认打分函数，也是第四章相关性调优的起点。</p>\n<p>第三篇讲 Top-K 检索与提前终止。既然用户只看前十条，把所有命中都算完分再排序就是浪费。WAND、MaxScore、Block-Max 这些动态剪枝算法利用每个词项的分数上界，提前跳过不可能进前 K 的文档，把查询从「全量打分」变成「按需打分」。这一篇直接建立在第一篇的命中归并与第三篇压缩的块式布局之上，是现代引擎低延迟的核心。</p>\n<p>读这一章的顺序就是查询自身的流动方向：解析、打分、剪枝。三者合起来，构成了「输入一个词、毫秒返回最相关十条」这件事的全部算法内核。</p>\n"}